---
layout: base.njk
langue: en
title: Wine list, natural wines from small growers
permalink: /en/wine-list/
alternate: /carte-des-vins/
description: "The wine list at Les Coltineurs, Paris 16th: Champagne and natural wines from small growers in the Loire, Burgundy, Beaujolais, Rhône and Languedoc."
ogImage: illustration-salle-aquarelle.jpg
jsonld: vins
---
<header class="titre-page conteneur">
  <p class="surtitre">The cellar</p>
  <h1>The wine list</h1>
  <p class="chapo">Exclusively small growers who farm and make their wines with care. Respect for the land and the terroir, right down to the glass.</p>
</header>

<div class="conteneur etroit">
  <ul class="sommaire" aria-label="Wine list sections">
    {%- for c in vins.categories %}<li><a href="#{{ c.id }}">{{ c.nom | trad }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="carte">
    {%- for c in vins.categories %}
    <section class="carte__categorie" id="{{ c.id }}" aria-labelledby="t-{{ c.id }}">
      <h2 id="t-{{ c.id }}">{{ c.nom | trad }}</h2>
      {%- for r in c.regions %}
      <div class="carte__groupe">
        {% if r.nom %}<h3>{{ r.nom | trad }}</h3>{% endif %}
        {%- for s in r.secteurs %}
        {% if s.nom and s.nom != r.nom %}<p class="carte__secteur">{{ s.nom | trad }}</p>{% endif %}
        <ul class="plats">
          {%- for v in s.vins %}
          <li class="plat">
            <span class="plat__nom">{{ v.domaine }}{% if v.domaine and v.cuvee %} · {% endif %}{{ v.cuvee }}{% if v.contenance %} ({{ v.contenance }}){% endif %}</span>
            <span class="plat__prix">{{ v.prix }}</span>
            <p class="plat__detail">{% if v.appellation %}<span>{{ v.appellation }}</span>{% endif %}{% if v.cepages %}<span>{{ v.cepages }}</span>{% endif %}{% if v.millesime %}<span>{{ v.millesime }}</span>{% endif %}{% if v.detail %}<span>{{ v.detail }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </section>
    {%- endfor %}
    <p class="carte__note">Prices in euros, service included. 75 cl bottles unless stated.<br>Please drink responsibly.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="boutons" style="justify-content:center; margin: 2.5rem 0 4rem;">
    <a class="bouton bouton--plein" href="{{ site.zenchef.reserver }}" rel="noopener">Book a table</a>
    <a class="bouton" href="/en/menu/">The menu</a>
  </div>
</div>
